# LottoPicker coding standard (docs/SDD.md "Coding Standards").
# LLVM base style, 100-column limit. Honored by CLion, VS Code, and
# Visual Studio's built-in ClangFormat integration alike.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
ColumnLimit: 100
